* Program: T_14_1_5.SAS
*
* Program Type: Table
*
* Purpose: To produce Table 14.1.5 Summary of Changes in Vital Signs
*          from Baseline to Final Visit (Safety Population)
* Usage Notes: Summarizes observed values and changes from baseline
*              for safety-population subjects by parameter, treatment,
*              and visit.
*
* SAS Version: 9.4
* Operating System: SAS OnDemand Linux server (client: Windows 11)
*
* Author: ANSANIA SALAM
